	"description":"A fluent testing framework for Spring's MockMvc that strictly enforces the Arrange-Act-Assert\n    (AAA) pattern while minimizing boilerplate in controller tests. With a strongly-typed,\n    step-by-step API, it guides developers through all test phases. Common tasks like request setup,\n    ObjectMapper-based serialization, and response validation are abstracted away, allowing full\n    focus on test logic.",
